@token = DÁN_ACCESS_TOKEN_CỦA_BẠN_VÀO_ĐÂY

### 1. Create Category ###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Gaming Gear",
    "slug": "gaming-gear"
}

### 2. Create Product (Initial stock = 10) ###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "categoryId": 1,
    "sku": "KB-K68-PRO",
    "name": "Mechanical Keyboard K68",
    "description": "Wireless hot-swappable mechanical keyboard",
    "price": 59.99,
    "initialStock": 10
}

### 3. Get Product By ID (Run twice to see Redis Cache in action!) ###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1

### 4. Add Item to Redis Cart ###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "productId": 1,
    "quantity": 2
}

### 5. View Redis Cart ###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Checkout Order (Deducts stock -> Clears Redis Cart -> Sends RabbitMQ Event) ###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. View Order History ###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
